        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia D12943, Jacksonville Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Jacksonville Entryset is made with the attention to quality and detail you would expect from Omnia Industries--a leader in door hardware. This Tubular Jacksonville Lockset is available in a wide selection of contemporary finish colors. Choose from dummy or single cylinder functions. This Modern Entry Set will fit most pre drilled doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching <a href=\"/products/jacksonville-lever-with-square-rose-omnia-943s-00\"> Jacksonville Door Lever</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Jacksonville Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit narrow stiles. For Door with a 2-3⁄8” backset, stile width can be as narrow as 3-5⁄8”</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia D12943 Jacksonville Lever Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 10-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Spacing (distance between deadbolt and lever latch): 5-1/2\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2\" Thick Doors (<a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> if doors are thicker)</li></li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw, Solid Brass with saw-proof Insert.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: \"T\" strike</li>\r\n<li>Each set contains door levers, backplates, latches, spindle, and all necessary screws and templates. Key functions are supplied with lock cylinder/s and turnpiece as applicable. </li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/entry-lockset-specs.pdf?v=1704262242\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia Entry Lockset Dimensions & Specs (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a lever operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MHE-starfish-brass.jpg?v=1704354584\" width=\"513\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
