                "title": "Jacksonville Entryset",
                "description": "The Jacksonville Entryset is made with the attention to quality and detail you would expect from Omnia Industries--a leader in door hardware. This Tubular Jacksonville Lockset is available in a wide selection of contemporary finish colors. Choose from dummy or single cylinder functions. This Modern Entry Set will fit most pre drilled doors. \r\n",
